      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "Use `runs-on: homelab`. A repo-scoped runner is created automatically within about two minutes after the workflow file contains that label, `homelab-<repo>`, or `web3-frozen/ci-template`. web3-frozen is a user account, so GitHub cannot share one organization runner across repositories.\n\n**Jobs / 24h** is throughput. **Failure rate by repository** is the flaky-repo list. **Startup p95** is queue plus image-pull time; a rising line means the two-pod CI quota is saturated. Counters reset when a listener restarts, so a range crossing a restart undercounts.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "How to read this",
      "type": "text"
    },
